\begin_layout Standard
The development of BiocPy is an adoption of Bioconductor’s design philosophy into a Pythonic context.
 The development of the ecosystem is guided by adherence to specific design principles that prioritize reliability,
 interoperability and usability.
 The goal is to provide objects that are structurally compatible with Bioconductor and interoperable with numpy and scipy.
 While BiocPy objects can be converted to popular Python packages (e.g.,
 pandas 
\begin_inset Flex Code
